	)
	(text "SAM driver output test board, schematic draft 0.1 (2026-11-17). Licence: CERN-OHL-S v2.\nReplaces the playfield harness on the I/O Power Driver board 520-5249-00 (J6-J10, J12, J13, J2, J3) and the switch\nharness on the CPU board (J1, J2, J3, J6, J12, J13). Every output sees < 1 mA: a stuck-on output cannot burn anything.\nThe 50 V and 20 V rails MUST be on during tests: each output has a 1N4004 flyback diode to its rail on the driver board.\nBoard ground = pinball ground (J10 pins 2-5, IO J12 pin 12, CPU connectors). USB to the PC is isolated (ADuM3160).\nIO J10 pin 1 carries 24 VAC: it is not connected on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
